{{ja-kanjitab|yomi=k|ほ}}

{{IPAchar|/po/}} → {{IPAchar|/ɸo/}} → {{IPAchar|/ho/}}

From {{inh|ja|ojp|sort=ほ|-}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{ja-pron|ほ}}

====Noun====
{{ja-noun|ほ}}

